            "summary": ">a feminine japanese cute body >a nice house >a childhood where I had worn cute girls' school uniforms and countless white tights to go along >cute clothes >living in a nice country, like Japan…",
            "html": "<article id=\"post-25957\" class=\"post-25957 post type-post status-publish format-aside hentry post_format-post-format-aside category-diario tag-depression tag-hate tag-life tag-poor tag-problems tag-sadness tag-transgender\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#diario\" rel=\"category\">Diário</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2019-05-06-all-the-things-i-wish.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">~ all the things I wish ~</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#aside\">Nota</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2019-05-06-all-the-things-i-wish.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2019-05-06T00:12:35-03:00\">06/05/2019</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2019-05-06-all-the-things-i-wish.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#depression\" rel=\"tag\">Depression</a> <a href=\"tag.html#hate\" rel=\"tag\">Hate</a> <a href=\"tag.html#life\" rel=\"tag\">Life</a> <a href=\"tag.html#poor\" rel=\"tag\">Poor</a> <a href=\"tag.html#problems\" rel=\"tag\">Problems</a> <a href=\"tag.html#sadness\" rel=\"tag\">Sadness</a> <a href=\"tag.html#transgender\" rel=\"tag\">Transgender</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\"><p><em><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/image_89.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-26011\" src=\"https://estranhosidade.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/wallpapers-random-ii-littledr3ams-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"316\" /></a>&gt;<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20181127002854/https://www.flickr.com/photos/beryl_snw/32933503243/in/photolist-UD6ERL-Tqz7QF-SYVy4Z-T9TrAy-TmurGd-SbdP8r-T3qVwJ-T3qVYW-RXpdag-TdELCs-SCZgWu-T5RB6H-TdEMf9-Ts2Ld8-TdbWY9-SS3sBo-MHFQXi-MFivh3-NbBWj3-MDVvTo/\">a feminine japanese cute body</a></em><br />\n<em>&gt;<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/cc77da59-f3ba-46a0-a2d1-028762f2646e.c10.jpg\">a nice house</a></em><br />\n<em>&gt;a childhood where I had worn cute girls&#8217; school uniforms and <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/depositphotos_119969832-stock-photo-cute-schoolgirl-in-uniform-at.jpg\">countless white tights to go along</a></em><br />\n<em>&gt;<a href=\"tag.html#moda\">cute clothes</a></em><br />\n<em>&gt;living in a nice country, like Japan or US</em><br />\n<em>&gt;a lot money to go around</em><br />\n<em>&gt;a father alive</em><br />\n<em>&gt;diapers with <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/wholesale-diapers-cute-adult-diaper-alibaba-adult.jpg_350x350.jpg\">cute patterns</a></em><br />\n<em>&gt;a bathtub</em><br />\n<em>&gt;a world where <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mission_Hill_(TV_series)\">Mission Hill</a> had more than one season</em><br />\n<em>&gt;<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190428080924/https://www.razer.com/campaigns/quartz\">a nice laptop</a>, one of those expansive and fancy ones, like a macbook, not the garbage they sell in my shithole</em><br />\n<em>&gt;a soundproofed room or a big house where I could watch TV loud at night without disturbing the neighbors or family<br />\n&gt;&#8230;so many goddammit things&#8230;</em></p>\n<p><em>&gt;and you see all those things, and like, they are not even high-class luxury things, not talking of private jets or caribbean islands here. They are bathtubs, ACs and some tasty snacks, cool things that are affordable in Europe and other first world countries and&#8230; it sucks, it really sucks. Things you don&#8217;t have, things you can&#8217;t have.</em></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"2017-02-02-nao-acho-que-pobre-deveria-ter-filhos.html\">&gt;the child is the house with plastered and painted walls, the child is the house without leaking roofs, the child is the health and dental insurance, the child is the bills up to date and not having to deal with creditors at your door, the child is the decent life standard.</a></em></p>\n</div></article>",
